WEBVTT

00:29.946 --> 00:32.741
‎Gyro. About what Laurence Boomboom said...

00:33.450 --> 00:37.828
‎You think we're the only ones
‎after your life?

00:37.829 --> 00:41.540
‎You've got a bounty on your head.

00:41.541 --> 00:43.418
‎What was he talking about?

00:44.127 --> 00:46.503
‎I told you it's none of your business.

00:46.504 --> 00:48.047
‎No! Answer me!

00:48.631 --> 00:50.507
‎I have a right to know.

00:50.508 --> 00:52.552
‎I almost died because of it!

00:56.181 --> 00:58.015
‎So you're a judicial official?

00:58.016 --> 01:02.227
‎Was Robinson after your bounty too?

01:02.228 --> 01:06.024
‎Why did you enter this race? Answer me!

02:42.579 --> 02:47.125
‎#05 - THE TERRORIST
‎FROM A FARAWAY COUNTRY

02:52.088 --> 02:57.468
‎2ND STAGE DAY 6
‎MIDPOINT

03:04.851 --> 03:08.061
‎Welcome. You made excellent time.

03:08.062 --> 03:11.357
‎You're currently in fourth place,

03:12.025 --> 03:13.359
‎Mr. Oye.

03:18.489 --> 03:22.451
‎This town was built
‎as the race's midpoint.

03:22.452 --> 03:27.205
‎Reports say you're over a day ahead
‎of the groups around Sand Man and Dio

03:27.206 --> 03:29.666
‎on the other route.

03:29.667 --> 03:33.378
‎Fourth? I'm not in first?

03:33.379 --> 03:36.089
‎First place is Mr. Mountain Tim.

03:36.090 --> 03:41.178
‎But Mr. Gyro Zeppeli
‎claims he was a neck ahead.

03:41.179 --> 03:45.849
‎Mr. Johnny Joestar also insisted
‎he came in first.

03:45.850 --> 03:52.105
‎But since this is only a checkpoint, it
‎doesn't affect the standings or records.

03:52.106 --> 03:53.191
‎That's right.

04:32.605 --> 04:36.651
‎I found a wax seal bearing
‎the royal coat of arms outside the hotel.

04:40.697 --> 04:41.864
‎There it is.

04:42.782 --> 04:46.202
‎So he did receive a letter
‎from the king's envoy.

04:49.497 --> 04:54.710
‎"Travel 30 miles north to the Red Canyon.
‎The Zombie Horse awaits you.

04:54.711 --> 04:55.961
‎Take it.

04:55.962 --> 05:00.299
‎The Zombie Horse has the power
‎to alleviate weariness and injury.

05:00.300 --> 05:02.010
‎It will serve you well."

05:03.219 --> 05:05.095
‎What's the Zombie Horse?

05:05.096 --> 05:07.264
‎Do I know you?

05:07.265 --> 05:09.850
‎Oh! Guess I was wrong!

05:09.851 --> 05:13.604
‎Then why are you in someone else's room,
‎going through his things?

05:15.773 --> 05:18.775
‎I'm looking for Gyro Zeppeli. Where is he?

05:18.776 --> 05:22.988
‎Well, here's an idiot
‎who can't hold a conversation.

05:22.989 --> 05:26.158
‎You know answering a question
‎with a question

05:26.159 --> 05:29.328
‎gets you an F, genius?

05:29.329 --> 05:32.456
‎I need to find Gyro Zeppeli.
‎Is he in the stable?

05:32.457 --> 05:35.168
‎Hey! Are you screwing with me?

05:41.132 --> 05:43.468
‎Oh, here's a word of warning.

05:44.052 --> 05:47.387
‎Don't let go of my skin yet.

05:47.388 --> 05:49.431
‎I'm about to step away.

05:49.432 --> 05:51.893
‎Don't spread your fingers. It's dangerous.

05:58.441 --> 06:05.198
‎Too bad. I told you not to spread
‎your fingers once you touched me.

06:08.993 --> 06:12.246
‎I won't spare anyone
‎who rides for the king.

06:13.081 --> 06:16.459
‎You'll die,
‎Judicial Official Gyro Zeppeli.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.256
‎What's that sound?

06:25.259 --> 06:28.220
‎An explosion! Get the fire pumps!

06:28.221 --> 06:30.680
‎Get the hoses from the water tank!

06:30.681 --> 06:32.224
‎What the...

06:32.225 --> 06:33.851
‎What happened?

06:42.151 --> 06:44.152
‎This can't be...

06:44.153 --> 06:45.530
‎Mountain Tim!

06:55.832 --> 06:57.833
‎Mountain Tim!

06:57.834 --> 07:02.295
‎He's alive! He tore his body apart
‎with his rope!

07:02.296 --> 07:05.383
‎Don't come... Gyro...

07:06.634 --> 07:07.843
‎This explosion...

07:07.844 --> 07:09.177
‎What was that?

07:09.178 --> 07:12.640
‎Stay back! He's hiding nearby!

07:13.182 --> 07:15.143
‎It's a Stand ability!

07:28.781 --> 07:31.575
‎He's here! Don't let him touch you!

07:31.576 --> 07:33.786
‎He's the enemy! Run!

07:37.582 --> 07:41.002
‎What the hell is that cowboy?

07:41.711 --> 07:44.464
‎What's he made of?

07:45.339 --> 07:48.550
‎Long time no see, Gyro Zeppeli.

07:48.551 --> 07:50.302
‎You...

07:50.303 --> 07:54.181
‎Damn it! Gyro, he touched you!

07:54.182 --> 07:57.185
‎He just touched you with his finger!

08:00.563 --> 08:03.023
‎What the hell is this?

08:03.024 --> 08:05.775
‎-He's stuck a pin on you!
‎-A pin?

08:05.776 --> 08:07.944
‎That's his ability!

08:07.945 --> 08:11.781
‎Hold them down!
‎If they pop out, they'll explode!

08:11.782 --> 08:13.241
‎What?

08:13.242 --> 08:15.911
‎Just do it! Hold them down!

08:15.912 --> 08:17.329
‎It's what happened to me!

08:17.330 --> 08:19.916
‎When they popped out, they exploded!

08:23.711 --> 08:26.338
‎What, you're telling him?

08:26.339 --> 08:29.591
‎Don't let go! That's the rule!

08:29.592 --> 08:31.427
‎They are like land mines!

08:31.552 --> 08:36.140
‎When they pop out, your hand will explode!

08:36.807 --> 08:41.353
‎These watch-like rings
‎are fused to my fingers.

08:41.354 --> 08:44.105
‎They even look like real mechanisms!

08:44.106 --> 08:45.608
‎That's a Stand!

08:47.235 --> 08:50.403
‎A Stand is a manifestation
‎of spiritual energy.

08:50.404 --> 08:55.826
‎It manifests from within us
‎and can inflict real damage!

08:56.327 --> 08:58.621
‎Even that explosion
‎comes from that energy!

09:01.290 --> 09:04.709
‎Gyro! He said, "Long time no see."

09:04.710 --> 09:06.337
‎Do you know him?

09:07.004 --> 09:09.549
‎Yeah. His name is Oye.

09:11.300 --> 09:15.929
‎He's a terrorist who bombed
‎the king's carriage two years ago

09:15.930 --> 09:20.308
‎The king wasn't aboard,
‎but five bystanders were killed.

09:20.309 --> 09:22.394
‎Two of them were children!

09:22.395 --> 09:25.313
‎He was captured and sentenced to death,

09:25.314 --> 09:29.277
‎but he planted hidden explosives
‎in a guard's ear and blew him up.

09:29.402 --> 09:30.486
‎Then he escaped!

09:31.612 --> 09:34.073
‎How's your old man?

09:34.824 --> 09:39.661
‎I hear he's retired,
‎and you've taken his place as executioner.

09:39.662 --> 09:40.871
‎Executioner?

09:43.916 --> 09:49.379
‎My father should've taken your head
‎when he had the chance.

09:49.380 --> 09:51.673
‎Too bad.

09:51.674 --> 09:55.093
‎My passing through Arizona was God's will.

09:55.094 --> 09:57.053
‎Even I was surprised.

09:57.054 --> 10:01.433
‎My talent with explosives
‎became an ability within me.

10:01.434 --> 10:03.893
‎You passed through the Devil's Palm?

10:03.894 --> 10:07.773
‎I took it as a mission from God!

10:09.775 --> 10:12.861
‎Gyro, one more thing.

10:12.862 --> 10:16.157
‎The quickest way
‎to stop a Stand ability is...

10:16.907 --> 10:20.661
‎Once the user dies,
‎and the ability dies with him!

10:21.329 --> 10:24.665
‎That's awfully nice of you
‎to explain all that.

10:25.166 --> 10:28.669
‎But I've already taken
‎his right hand out of play.

10:29.837 --> 10:31.213
‎You know what?

10:32.256 --> 10:38.179
‎It's like a man drowning in debt
‎turning to loan sharks.

10:41.515 --> 10:43.726
‎There's no way out!

10:46.979 --> 10:48.189
‎A rat?

10:48.856 --> 10:51.566
‎Stay away from the rat!
‎Don't let it near you!

10:51.567 --> 10:53.402
‎It's a bomb now!

11:04.997 --> 11:06.956
‎Gyro! Don't let go!

11:06.957 --> 11:08.751
‎Don't even move your fingers!

11:14.757 --> 11:17.384
‎The pin popped out! Gyro, grab it!

11:17.385 --> 11:19.344
‎The pin came out of your hand!

11:19.345 --> 11:22.473
‎Put it back! Stick it back
‎where it came out!

11:23.766 --> 11:27.477
‎Didn't it come out of your palm?

11:27.478 --> 11:30.940
‎Isn't it on the palm side,
‎where you're gripping the Steel Ball?

11:32.775 --> 11:35.860
‎Just put it back! It'll explode!

11:35.861 --> 11:38.363
‎No! It's on the palm side!

11:38.364 --> 11:42.993
‎If he makes room to put it back,
‎more pins will pop out!

11:57.508 --> 11:59.427
‎From the back of his hand...

12:07.226 --> 12:08.310
‎He got it back in.

12:08.978 --> 12:12.022
‎You did it! It didn't explode!

12:14.400 --> 12:18.153
‎That really had me sweating.

12:18.154 --> 12:21.823
‎It's been four days
‎since I gained this ability in the desert.

12:21.824 --> 12:26.537
‎Now I understand everything
‎about my ability.

12:28.372 --> 12:32.376
‎God's power has no weaknesses.

12:33.210 --> 12:37.464
‎Do your best to keep those pins
‎from popping out.

12:37.465 --> 12:40.885
‎Gyro! Johnny! Don't let him get away!

12:41.594 --> 12:43.928
‎Get away?

12:43.929 --> 12:46.222
‎It's already over.

12:46.223 --> 12:48.975
‎Gyro won't make it three more steps.

12:48.976 --> 12:52.354
‎His hands are only going to get sweatier!

12:54.899 --> 12:57.818
‎Stay back, Johnny! Don't come near me!

12:59.111 --> 13:00.653
‎You're sweating!

13:00.654 --> 13:02.572
‎You noticed?

13:02.573 --> 13:07.368
‎Anything that his hand touches
‎will make the pins pop out.

13:07.369 --> 13:10.121
‎Damn it! This is impossible.

13:10.122 --> 13:13.583
‎What do I do? The more I hold them,
‎the more I sweat!

13:13.584 --> 13:15.793
‎More pins are coming out!

13:15.794 --> 13:17.086
‎Wipe it off, Gyro!

13:17.087 --> 13:20.423
‎No! The sweat and the pins
‎are stuck together.

13:20.424 --> 13:22.342
‎They keep flowing out!

13:22.343 --> 13:23.426
‎Damn it!

13:23.427 --> 13:25.845
‎I've got to take him down.

13:25.846 --> 13:29.265
‎I'll throw this Steel Ball and finish him!

13:29.266 --> 13:33.269
‎I see. That might work.

13:33.270 --> 13:36.898
‎If your right hand
‎is going to blow off anyway,

13:36.899 --> 13:39.610
‎you might as well take your shot
‎and throw it.

13:40.236 --> 13:43.697
‎But the moment you let go,
‎it'll blow to pieces.

14:02.550 --> 14:03.968
‎Gyro!

14:04.552 --> 14:06.844
‎The blast shifted.

14:06.845 --> 14:09.305
‎I'll take that bastard out.

14:09.306 --> 14:12.226
‎Better than losing my arm!

14:15.271 --> 14:16.730
‎You did it!

14:20.818 --> 14:22.902
‎You're not getting away, Oye!

14:22.903 --> 14:24.863
‎Are you going after him?

14:24.864 --> 14:28.825
‎The one the letter said... He's after it.

14:28.826 --> 14:29.909
‎After what?

14:29.910 --> 14:32.203
‎It's the king's gift.

14:32.204 --> 14:34.414
‎The Zombie Horse at Red Canyon.

14:34.415 --> 14:35.623
‎The Zombie Horse?

14:35.624 --> 14:38.376
‎I can't let him have it.

14:38.377 --> 14:42.715
‎The horse which alleviates weariness
‎and even injuries!

14:46.302 --> 14:48.679
‎I'll get it before he does.

14:53.517 --> 14:54.935
‎[STAND NAME] TIC TAC BOOM
‎[STAND MASTER] OYE

15:04.945 --> 15:07.906
‎Johnny. He's my enemy.

15:07.907 --> 15:12.160
‎This is between him, me, and my country.
‎It has nothing to do with you.

15:12.161 --> 15:14.787
‎I don't know what happened to you.

15:14.788 --> 15:16.706
‎You don't have to tell me.

15:16.707 --> 15:19.376
‎But I'm coming with you, of course!

15:21.670 --> 15:25.757
‎I don't take orders,
‎and I don't need help.

15:25.758 --> 15:29.677
‎But you've dragged me into this
‎since the starting line.

15:29.678 --> 15:31.639
‎It's too late to split up now!

15:32.848 --> 15:34.141
‎Suit yourself.

15:43.692 --> 15:46.319
‎They've figured out my ability.

15:46.320 --> 15:50.240
‎Now I need to understand Gyro Zeppeli's.

15:50.866 --> 15:53.577
‎What's the range
‎of his Steel Ball attack?

15:54.286 --> 15:56.997
‎Judging by that throw,
‎it's about 20 yards.

15:57.665 --> 16:02.711
‎Any closer and he'll get me.
‎Any farther, and my explosions won't work.

16:03.712 --> 16:07.591
‎I have to attack
‎from just beyond his range.

16:11.220 --> 16:14.974
‎He's pouring water from his canteen.

16:24.400 --> 16:26.985
‎Gyro! Get out of the water!

16:26.986 --> 16:29.696
‎He's turned the water into bombs!

16:29.697 --> 16:33.783
‎There are pins in the water! Get to shore!

16:33.784 --> 16:36.870
‎No. You get to shore alone.

16:38.080 --> 16:41.500
‎I'll do the opposite. I'll keep running
‎and catch up to him.

16:44.586 --> 16:45.879
‎Wait, Gyro!

16:49.758 --> 16:50.801
‎There you are.

17:04.440 --> 17:06.816
‎Even if we touch his land-mine pins,

17:06.817 --> 17:09.610
‎the explosion won't come
‎until a moment later.

17:09.611 --> 17:13.282
‎We'll speed up
‎and make it explode behind us!

17:15.826 --> 17:17.910
‎We're pushing through!

17:17.911 --> 17:20.621
‎It's worse to leave the river
‎and slow down!

17:20.622 --> 17:23.166
‎Don't let the horses hesitate!

17:23.167 --> 17:25.961
‎I'll get close
‎and slam the Steel Ball into him!

17:30.883 --> 17:32.800
‎Gyro Zeppeli...

17:32.801 --> 17:34.469
‎You're getting cocky.

17:34.470 --> 17:36.095
‎Knew you'd speed up.

17:36.096 --> 17:39.557
‎I'm not running from you.

17:39.558 --> 17:42.560
‎I'm herding you into this river!

17:42.561 --> 17:44.521
‎It's a waterfall, Gyro!

17:49.318 --> 17:50.611
‎Push through!

17:51.278 --> 17:55.282
‎Don't slow down!
‎Make it up, just like he did!

18:10.506 --> 18:13.133
‎Wasps! They're coming at us!

18:13.717 --> 18:16.678
‎Every wasp has a pin on it!

18:18.347 --> 18:20.973
‎We'll have to cut them down one by one!

18:20.974 --> 18:22.810
‎With my fingernail shots!

18:31.485 --> 18:33.487
‎I'll hit him from here!

18:36.907 --> 18:40.702
‎Forty yards! It won't be fatal.

18:41.495 --> 18:44.163
‎My explosions are stronger!

18:44.164 --> 18:47.376
‎You'll be the ones
‎to take the wasps and blow up!

18:53.715 --> 18:55.967
‎The wasps hit the spider web.

18:55.968 --> 18:57.344
‎Get down, Johnny!

19:06.019 --> 19:08.814
‎Yes! We made it up the falls!

19:16.655 --> 19:17.823
‎Gyro!

19:20.868 --> 19:23.787
‎This... This smell...

19:26.748 --> 19:27.958
‎Johnny! Stop!

19:29.042 --> 19:30.043
‎Don't move.

19:31.003 --> 19:32.004
‎What's this?

19:37.634 --> 19:39.177
‎Don't touch the smoke.

19:39.178 --> 19:42.222
‎Don't open your mouth. Don't inhale.
‎Hold your breath!

19:42.973 --> 19:45.183
‎Don't let the horses breathe either!

19:45.184 --> 19:46.684
‎What?

19:46.685 --> 19:48.728
‎Hold your breath?

19:48.729 --> 19:51.648
‎Impossible. Not while you're alive.

19:52.149 --> 19:56.903
‎Did you think all I sent at you
‎was water and wasps?

19:56.904 --> 19:59.530
‎Even what I breathe in and breathe out!

19:59.531 --> 20:02.492
‎Anything I touch can become a land mine!

20:05.078 --> 20:09.790
‎You're like rats
‎trapped in a cage over a fire.

20:09.791 --> 20:13.253
‎There's no escape left.
‎There's nothing you can do!

20:15.923 --> 20:19.508
‎God has granted me an incredible ability.

20:19.509 --> 20:24.389
‎When I return home, I'll assassinate
‎even the king with this ability!

20:34.691 --> 20:38.110
‎If we don't finish him, it's over.

20:38.111 --> 20:40.530
‎But where is he?

20:44.576 --> 20:45.577
‎Gyro!

20:46.161 --> 20:48.497
‎It should explode any second now.

20:57.673 --> 20:58.715
‎This is...

20:59.925 --> 21:02.511
‎The wasps that got caught on that thread?

21:03.262 --> 21:05.221
‎You're dreaming!

21:05.222 --> 21:10.434
‎You think wasps I made into mines
‎can really blow me up?

21:10.435 --> 21:12.354
‎I'll rip it apart!

21:15.107 --> 21:16.857
‎What's this?

21:16.858 --> 21:20.195
‎They're not wasps... They're spinning.

21:27.494 --> 21:29.078
‎There you are!

21:29.079 --> 21:33.416
‎You mistook the sound of
‎Johnny's spinning nails for a wasp.

21:33.417 --> 21:36.502
‎Then you pulled it in
‎to cut the spider's thread.

21:36.503 --> 21:39.422
‎So now I know where you are!

21:39.423 --> 21:41.216
‎One more!

21:52.769 --> 21:55.772
‎-Let's keep charging through, Johnny.
‎-Right!

21:56.565 --> 21:59.651
‎We're still first and second!

22:00.319 --> 22:01.737
‎That's us!

23:30.992 --> 23:35.997
‎Subtitle translation by: Ryoko Quirke
